Source: homelab-mail-proxy
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Jeff Gardner <mailmasker-api01@forge.name>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/permittivity2/homelab-api

Package: homelab-mail-proxy
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, haproxy (>= 2.4), adduser
Description: HAProxy TCP passthrough frontends for the Homelab mail stack
 Templated frontends/backends for SMTP(25)/SMTPS(465)/Submission(587)/
 Roundcube-SMTPS(10465, optional)/IMAP(143)/IMAPS(993), safe to install
 on a shared proxy host without touching other frontends: config is a
 drop-in file plus a systemd EXTRAOPTS override, never editing
 haproxy.cfg or /etc/default/haproxy.
